{
  "$comment": [
    "Corpus for W4.1c sub-unit c.2 — v4's processToolCalls. Drives BOTH the v4",
    "oracle (tool-execution-process-tier3.test.ts) and the Rust port (quilltap-",
    "harness tool_execution_process tier-3 test). ONLY executeToolCallWithContext",
    "is mocked; both sides inject the SAME canned per-call results keyed by",
    "name|JSON.stringify(arguments)|callId (arguments kept single-key so the key +",
    "the emitted frames match byte-for-byte; the RESULT comparison is by parsed",
    "JSON Value, order-insensitive).",
    "",
    "Banks: a success dispatch (status frame on, pretty-JSON content); a failure",
    "(status off, the `Error: <error> - <message>` text + the failure toolResult",
    "frame carrying it); generate_image (image-path extraction from the result",
    "array + the count summary text + metadata); and a mixed batch (a vault-read",
    "success WITH metadata + a failure, two status+result frame pairs)."
  ],
  "batches": [
    {
      "name": "success_with_status",
      "statusContext": { "characterName": "Friday", "characterId": "char-1" },
      "toolCalls": [
        { "name": "state", "arguments": { "action": "get" }, "callId": "c-state" }
      ],
      "cannedResults": [
        { "toolName": "state", "success": true, "result": { "mood": "curious" } }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "failure_no_status",
      "toolCalls": [
        { "name": "search", "arguments": { "query": "x" } }
      ],
      "cannedResults": [
        { "toolName": "search", "success": false, "result": null, "error": "NOT_FOUND", "message": "no character" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "generate_image_with_paths",
      "statusContext": { "characterName": "Friday", "characterId": "char-1" },
      "toolCalls": [
        { "name": "generate_image", "arguments": { "prompt": "a cat" }, "callId": "c-img" }
      ],
      "cannedResults": [
        {
          "toolName": "generate_image",
          "success": true,
          "result": [
            { "id": "img-1", "filepath": "/tmp/1.png", "filename": "1.png", "mimeType": "image/png", "size": 4096, "width": 512, "height": 512, "sha256": "deadbeef" },
            { "id": "", "filepath": "/tmp/skip.png" }
          ],
          "metadata": { "provider": "OPENAI", "model": "dall-e-3", "expandedPrompt": "a fluffy cat, studio lighting" }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "mixed_batch",
      "statusContext": { "characterName": "Friday", "characterId": "char-1" },
      "toolCalls": [
        { "name": "doc_read_file", "arguments": { "path": "a.md" }, "callId": "c-doc" },
        { "name": "whisper", "arguments": { "to": "self" } }
      ],
      "cannedResults": [
        { "toolName": "doc_read_file", "success": true, "result": { "body": "hello" }, "metadata": { "provider": "ANTHROPIC", "model": "claude", "expandedPrompt": "read a.md" } },
        { "toolName": "whisper", "success": false, "result": null, "error": "DENIED" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
